#, no-c-format
msgid "Introduction"
msgstr "Introduccion"

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:60
#, no-c-format
msgid "What is &kpoker;?"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:62
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&kpoker; is a <ulink url=\"http://www.kde.org\">&kde;</ulink> compliant "
"clone of those highly addictive pocket video poker games which are sometimes "
"called <quote>Videopoker</quote> as well."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:68
#, no-c-format
msgid "Where do I get the latest version of &kpoker;?"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:70
#, no-c-format
msgid "The latest version of &kpoker; is always available at"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:73
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The &kpoker; homepage: <ulink url=\"http://kpoker.sourceforge.net/\">http://"
"kpoker.sourceforge.net/</ulink>"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:76
#, no-c-format
msgid "The &kde; homepage: &kde-http;"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:85
#, no-c-format
msgid "Starting a new game"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:87
#, no-c-format
msgid "You can start a new game two ways:"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:91
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"By selecting <menuchoice> <guimenu>Game</guimenu> <guimenuitem>New</"
"guimenuitem></menuchoice> from the menubar."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:95
#, no-c-format
msgid "Selecting <keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;<keycap>N</keycap></keycombo>"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:99
#, no-c-format
msgid "Either way, you will be presented with a dialog box."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: index.docbook:102
#, no-c-format
msgid "<screeninfo><acronym>AI</acronym> Configure Dialog</screeninfo>"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:105
#, no-c-format
msgid "<phrase><acronym>AI</acronym> Configure Dialog</phrase>"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:111
#, no-c-format
msgid "How many players do you want?"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:112
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Will determine if you play a <link linkend=\"one-player-game\">one player "
"game</link> (against the house), or a <link linkend=\"two-player-game\">two "
"player game</link>."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:118
#, no-c-format
msgid "Your name:"
msgstr "Vòstre nom :"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:119
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Lets you personalize &kpoker; so that it calls you by name (instead of "
"<guilabel>You</guilabel>you>)."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:124
#, no-c-format
msgid "Player's starting money:"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:125
#, no-c-format
msgid "Lets you set the money you start each game with."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:130
#, no-c-format
msgid "The names of your opponents:"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:131
#, no-c-format
msgid "lets you set the name of the other player."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:135
#, no-c-format
msgid "Show this dialog every time on startup"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:137
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If this is checked, the first game after you start &kpoker; will show this "
"menu. If this option is not checked, then the game will not show this menu "
"for the first game."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:143
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"When you are satisfied with your settings, click <guibutton>OK</guibutton>, "
"to start the game. Clicking <guibutton>Cancel</guibutton>, will cancel the "
"start of a new game."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:151
#, no-c-format
msgid "One player game"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:154
#, no-c-format
msgid "How do I play ?"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:156
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"At the beginning of the game you get $100. You draw five cards and decide "
"which ones you want to keep. You indicate which cards you want to keep by "
"clicking on the face of the card. The word <guilabel>Held</guilabel> will "
"appear above the card."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:161
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"After doing this you draw new cards for those you did not want to keep. This "
"is accomplished by clicking on <guibutton>Draw New Cards</guibutton>."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:165
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The game now looks if you have any <link linkend=\"hands\">poker hand</link> "
"and gives cash according to the kind of hand you got (see <link linkend="
"\"scoring\">scoring</link>)."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:169
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Now you start over, drawing five cards, deciding which ones you want to "
"keep ..."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:172
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The game ends if you cannot pay for another round or if you close the "
"&kpoker; window."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:178
#, no-c-format
msgid "What are possible poker hands ?"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:180
#, no-c-format
msgid "Possible poker hands are:"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: term
#: index.docbook:184
#, no-c-format
msgid "Jacks or higher"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:185
#, no-c-format
msgid "Two cards of the same rank, both Jacks or higher"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: term
#: index.docbook:190
#, no-c-format
msgid "Two pairs"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:191
#, no-c-format
msgid "Two cards of one rank and two cards of another rank"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: term
#: index.docbook:196
#, no-c-format
msgid "<term>Three of a kind</term>"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:197
#, no-c-format
msgid "Three cards of the same rank"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: term
#: index.docbook:201
#, no-c-format
msgid "<term>Four of a kind</term>"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:202
#, no-c-format
msgid "Four cards of the same rank"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: term
#: index.docbook:206
#, no-c-format
msgid "<term>Full House</term>"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:207
#, no-c-format
msgid "Three cards of one rank and two cards of another"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: term
#: index.docbook:212
#, no-c-format
msgid "<term>Straight</term>"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:213
#, no-c-format
msgid "Five cards of consecutive rank including the combo ace-2-3-4-5"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: term
#: index.docbook:218
#, no-c-format
msgid "<term>Flush</term>"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:219
#, no-c-format
msgid "Five cards of the same suit"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: term
#: index.docbook:223
#, no-c-format
msgid "Straight flush"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:224
#, no-c-format
msgid "Five cards of the same suit and of consecutive rank"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: term
#: index.docbook:229
#, no-c-format
msgid "Royal flush"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:230
#, no-c-format
msgid "Ace, king, queen, jack, and ten of the same suit"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:239
#, no-c-format
msgid "How many bucks do I get for what hand ?"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: entry
#: index.docbook:246
#, no-c-format
msgid "A pair of Jacks or higher cards"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: entry
#: index.docbook:246
#, no-c-format
msgid "<entry>$5</entry>"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: entry
#: index.docbook:247
#, no-c-format
msgid "Two Pairs"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: entry
#: index.docbook:247
#, no-c-format
msgid "<entry>$10</entry>"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: entry
#: index.docbook:248
#, no-c-format
msgid "<entry>Three of a kind</entry>"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: entry
#: index.docbook:248
#, no-c-format
msgid "<entry>$15</entry>"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: entry
#: index.docbook:249
#, no-c-format
msgid "<entry>Straight</entry>"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: entry
#: index.docbook:249
#, no-c-format
msgid "<entry>$20</entry>"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: entry
#: index.docbook:250
#, no-c-format
msgid "<entry>Flush</entry>"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: entry
#: index.docbook:250
#, no-c-format
msgid "<entry>$25</entry>"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: entry
#: index.docbook:251
#, no-c-format
msgid "<entry>Full House</entry>"
