#. Tag: entry
#: index.docbook:253
#, no-c-format
msgid "Straight Flush"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: entry
#: index.docbook:253
#, no-c-format
msgid "$250"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: entry
#: index.docbook:254
#, no-c-format
msgid "Royal Flush"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: entry
#: index.docbook:254
#, no-c-format
msgid "$2000"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:263
#, no-c-format
msgid "Two player game"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:265
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The two player game is very different from a <link linkend=\"one-player-game"
"\">one player game</link>."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:269
#, no-c-format
msgid "Starting a two player game"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:271
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To start a two player game, select <menuchoice><guimenu>Game</guimenu> "
"<guimenuitem>New</guimenuitem> </menuchoice> on the menubar. This will bring "
"up a dialog. Simply select the number of players on the slider or in the "
"spinbox labeled <guilabel>How many players do you want?</guilabel>. Then "
"click <guibutton>OK</guibutton>."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:279
#, no-c-format
msgid "Playing a two player game"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:281
#, no-c-format
msgid "There are four phases to a two-player game:"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:284
#, no-c-format
msgid "you begin to draw cards"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:285
#, no-c-format
msgid "then you bet some money"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:286
#, no-c-format
msgid "after that you exchange your cards"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:287
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"then you raise and finally you will see the cards of the other player and "
"the winner will get all the money."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: term
#: index.docbook:293
#, no-c-format
msgid "<term>Draw</term>"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:294
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You will begin the game with $100. After clicking on the <guibutton>Draw New "
"Cards</guibutton> button you will get five cards. That's all, here."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: term
#: index.docbook:300
#, no-c-format
msgid "<term>Bet</term>"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:301
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Now you decide if your cards are good or not. If they are, you bet some "
"money - at least $5 and maximal $20. Just click on the <guibutton>+$5</"
"guibutton> and similar buttons."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: term
#: index.docbook:306
#, no-c-format
msgid "Exchange"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:307
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Now you decide which cards you want to keep. Click on them. If you have a "
"royal flush then don't exchange any cards! When you think you are ready then "
"click again on the <guibutton>Draw New Cards</guibutton> button - you will "
"probably get new cards."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:312
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Perhaps you do not get new cards - then the computer player has quite good "
"cards (or at least not very bad cards) and he has raised. You have to decide "
"to adjust your bet or to get out of the round. By default you will adjust "
"your bet. Click again on the <guibutton>Draw New Cards</guibutton> button "
"when ready."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: term
#: index.docbook:320
#, no-c-format
msgid "Raise"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:322
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"After you got new cards you are allowed to raise a little bit. It is the "
"same as the bet phase so I don't explain it again. Click on the draw button "
"(which is now labeled with <guilabel>See!</guilabel>) when ready."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: term
#: index.docbook:329
#, no-c-format
msgid "See / Draw"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:330
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"I know I said there are four phases and this one is the fifth. But it is "
"nearly the same as the draw phase. You will also see the cards of the "
"computer player and the winning cards are blinking. The winner gets all "
"money. Click on draw to begin a new round!"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:335
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The blinking cards are not necessarily the best cards of that player. Only "
"the cards which caused the win are blinking. So if you have two pairs (&eg; "
"2 * 2 and 2 * 3) and an ace, but only the ace is blinking, then the computer "
"player also has these two pairs (2 * 2 and 2 * 3) but not an ace."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:348
#, no-c-format
msgid "Commands and Keyboard Shortcuts"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:350
#, no-c-format
msgid "The following sections briefly describe each menubar option."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:353
#, no-c-format
msgid "<guimenu>Game</guimenu> Menu"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:355
#, no-c-format
msgid "The <guimenu>Game</guimenu> menu consists of three options."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: index.docbook:359
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<shortcut> <keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;<keycap>N</keycap></keycombo> </"
"shortcut> <guimenu>Game</guimenu> <guimenuitem>New</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:365
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<action>Starts a new game</action> of &kpoker;. For more information, see "
"the section entitled <link linkend=\"new-game\">Starting a new game</link>."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: index.docbook:370
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<shortcut> <keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;<keycap>S</keycap></keycombo> </"
"shortcut> <guimenu>Game</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Save</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:376
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<action>Saves your current game</action> to disk. This will replace any "
"previously saved games."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: index.docbook:380
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<shortcut> <keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;<keycap>Q</keycap></keycombo> </"
"shortcut> <guimenu>Game</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Quit</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:386
#, no-c-format
msgid "<action>Quits</action> &kpoker;"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:392
#, no-c-format
msgid "<guimenu>Settings</guimenu> Menu"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:394
#, no-c-format
msgid "The settings menu is used to adjust the sound, look and behavior of &kpoker;."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: index.docbook:399
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<shortcut> <keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;<keycap>M</keycap></keycombo> </"
"shortcut> <guimenu>Settings</guimenu><guimenuitem>Show Menubar</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:404
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This toggles the menubar on or off. If it is off, and you need to use the "
"menubar, you can right click in the playing area of &kpoker; and a menu will "
"appear. You can then select <guilabel>Show Menubar</guilabel> to turn it "
"back on."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: index.docbook:408
#, no-c-format
msgid "<guimenu>Settings</guimenu><guimenuitem>Show Statusbar</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:410
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This option will <action>toggle the status bar on or off</action>. The "
"status bar is located at the bottom of the &kpoker; window, and contains "
"instructions for play, and how much you won on the previous hand."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: index.docbook:415
#, no-c-format
msgid "<guimenu>Settings</guimenu><guimenuitem>Sound</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:417
#, no-c-format
msgid "This option will <action>toggle the sound on or off</action>."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: index.docbook:421
#, no-c-format
msgid "<guimenu>Settings</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Blinking Cards</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:424
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If this option has a check beside it, then when you win a hand, the "
"<action>cards which won you the money will blink</action>. If this option is "
"not checked, no cards blink."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: index.docbook:429
#, no-c-format
msgid "<guimenu>Settings</guimenu><guimenuitem>Adjust Bet is Default.</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:432
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If this option does not have a check in front of it, and you are playing a 2 "
"person game, you will be responsible for clicking <guibutton>Adjust Bet</"
"guibutton>, if your opponent raises the stakes, because the default action "
"will be to <quote>fold</quote> your hand in defeat."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:436
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If, on the other hand, the option does have a check in front of it, and you "
"are in the same situation, the default action of the game, is to match your "
"opponents bet, and you will be responsible for folding your hand."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: index.docbook:442
#, no-c-format
msgid "<guimenu>Settings</guimenu><guimenuitem>Save Settings</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:445
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This saves all your options to your hard drive. These options will be "
"restored automatically when you restart &kpoker;."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: index.docbook:450
#, no-c-format
msgid "<guimenu>Settings</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Configure Shortcuts...</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: action
#: index.docbook:455
#, no-c-format
msgid "Customize the keyboard shortcuts."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: index.docbook:460
#, no-c-format
msgid "<guimenu>Settings</guimenu><guimenuitem>Configure Carddecks...</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:462
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This will open a new window where you can select the front and back of the "
"cards for &kpoker;."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: index.docbook:466
#, no-c-format
msgid "<guimenu>Settings</guimenu><guimenuitem>Configure KPoker...</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:468
#, no-c-format
msgid "This opens a dialog box."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: index.docbook:470
#, no-c-format
msgid "AI Configure Dialog"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:475
#, no-c-format
msgid "There are either one or three options to adjust:"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:477
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The top text box determines in milliseconds how long to delay before showing "
"the next card. This can be used to speed up the deals, if you are not "
"interested in the more realistic default speed."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:481
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The text box labeled <guilabel>Maximal bet:</guilabel>, determines the "
"maximum bet for each hand."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:484
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The text box labeled <guilabel>Minimal bet:</guilabel> determines the "
"smallest allowable bet for each hand."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:487
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The <guilabel>Maximal bet:</guilabel> and <guilabel>Minimal bet:</guilabel> "
